script = ExtResource("1_curtain")
Tips = PackedStringArray("The last level of a circle belongs to its boss. Slay it to open the next circle in the hub.", "Press {open_town_portal} to open a Town Portal to the hub. It takes a minute to recharge.", "Press {toggle_loot_labels} to show or hide the names of the items on the ground.", "Press {toggle_overlay_map} to look at the map of this level.", "Press {toggle_character_sheet} to open your character sheet and inventory.", "Press {close_windows} to close all open windows at once.", "Every level you set foot in becomes a checkpoint. The portal of its circle in the hub takes you back there.", "Slain enemies stay dead until you begin a new descent.", "Loot left on the ground is lost once you leave the level.", "Right-click a slot of the skill bar to choose the skill or potion it holds.", "Hold {stand_still} while you attack to strike from where you stand instead of walking to the enemy.", "Hold Shift over an item to compare it with the one you wear.", "Shields and staves block attacks. Swords and daggers parry them.", "The gold you carry stays where you die. Walk back to pick it up before you leave the level.", "Gold in your stash is safe. The chest in the hub keeps your items and your gold.", "Hold Ctrl and click an item to move it to the open stash or to sell it to the merchant.", "Right-click an item at the merchant to buy it. Hold Ctrl to buy a full stack of potions.", "The merchant restocks when you reach a new level or gain a level.", "Sold something by mistake? The merchant sells it back for the same price until you leave the hub.")

